  "description": "Hong Dan-U, a man in his 20s with wild hair, has been avoiding hair salons for years due to a private secret – having his head touched tends to raise his \"other head.\" However, when his boss asks him to tidy up his appearance, Dan-U can no longer avoid the salons. When he reluctantly steps into one, he encounters the strikingly attractive stylist, Tae-Han. As the man trims his unruly mop, Dan-U quickly gets turned on. And with his huge secret out, Dan-U finds both his hair and body tangled in quite a mess! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon, edited)",
